WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.184
A writing task needs a clear purpose, intended reader, and appropriate format:

00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:07.261
letter, report, story or explanation.

00:00:08.117 --> 00:00:13.173
Which sentence is a topic sentence? Answer: Our school garden needs regular care.

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:18.513
Convert the same school message into a friendly note and a short formal notice.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:23.569
Why it works: A topic sentence introduces the paragraph's main point.
